ent-ActionCreateBlobFactory = Create blob factory (80)
    .desc = Turns the selected normal blob tile into a factory that can produce 3 spores and a blobbernaut, as long as a node or core is nearby.
ent-ActionCreateBlobResource = Create resource blob (60)
    .desc = Turns the selected normal blob tile into a resource blob that produces resources when a node or core is nearby.
ent-ActionCreateBlobNode = Create blob node (50)
    .desc =
        Turns the selected normal blob tile into a blob node.
        Nodes activate the effects of other blob tiles, heal and expand within their range, destroying walls and creating normal blob tiles.
ent-ActionCreateBlobbernaut = Produce blobbernaut on factory (60)
    .desc = Produces a blobbernaut on the selected factory once. It takes damage away from blob tiles and heals near nodes.
ent-ActionSplitBlobCore = Split core (200)
    .desc = Allows you to turn the selected node into an independent core that will grow on its own.
ent-ActionSwapBlobCore = Move core (100)
    .desc = Swaps your core with the selected node.
ent-ActionTeleportBlobToCore = Teleport to core
    .desc = Teleports your view to your core.
ent-ActionTeleportBlobToNode = Teleport to a random node
    .desc = Teleports your view to one of your nodes.
ent-ActionSwapBlobChem = Change blob chemical (40)
    .desc = Lets you change your current chemical to one of 4 random ones.
ent-ActionTransformToBlob = Transform into blob
    .desc = Instantly tears your body apart and creates a blob core. Beware: if there are no blob tiles under you, you will simply vanish.
ent-ActionPlantBlobMine = Plant a mine (25)
    .desc = Turns the selected tile next to your blob tiles into a mine. The mine is invisible: anyone stepping on it is set on fire and takes 15-20 heat damage.
ent-BlobMineTile = blob mine
    .desc = A mine hidden inside the biomass. Better keep your distance.
